{"3821910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Blind Warrior", "steam_appid": 3821910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLOT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in 1860s Java during the Dutch colonial rule, <strong>The Blind Warrior</strong> is a story-driven, action-adventure inspired by Indonesian folklore, Silat combat, and dark mysticism.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Barda, a blind Silat warrior seeking revenge after his village is destroyed. Journey through forests, villages, and war-torn lands as you face colonial armies, corrupt rulers, ruthless bandits, and forbidden mystics, while struggling to hold on to the humanity you still carry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silat-inspired combat and stealth with melee combo and throw mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a compact  world inspired by 1860s Java using heightened blind senses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey alongside a loyal monkey companion and shape character fates through moral choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821910/extras/917ac19e9cae899d4a4a7d978f706187.poster.avif?t=1781405795\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821910/extras/917ac19e9cae899d4a4a7d978f706187.webm?t=1781405795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3821910/extras/917ac19e9cae899d4a4a7d978f706187.mp4?t=1781405795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=